<title>SPAIN: FORECAST-Repsol H1 profit seen falling.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Repsol H1 profit seen falling.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts of first half consolidated results for Repsol, due this week. Figures in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>			    H1 1996	H1 1995	  RANGE</p>
<p> Operating margin     97.24	  111.38	 99.12-95.26</p>
<p> Net attrib profit    61.94	   62.16	 65.00-59.17</p>
<p>NOTE - The contribution from chemical activities is expected to continue to decline.</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTORS - Ibersecurities, Ahorro Corporacion, Societe Generale, Inverban.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
